\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Terms of the heat flux delivered to the electrode, equation~(\ref {eq:bc-qwall}), positive into the electrode, for the cathode (left) and the anode (right). Orange: heating; blue: emission cooling; black: the net heat flux \(q_w\). At the cathode, \(q_w\) equals the conduction \(k_w(T_{\rm  wall}-T_0)/L_w\) into the electrode body, equation~(\ref {eq:bc-heat-balance}); the anode surface temperature is prescribed.}}{17}{figure.8}\protected@file@percent }
